<DocsLayout>
  <h1>Introduction</h1>
  <p>Yora Academy is an online learning platform designed to provide high-quality educational content for students and professionals alike. Our platform offers interactive courses, real-world projects, and expert-led instruction.</p>

  <h2>Features</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Interactive courses with hands-on exercises</li>
    <li>Progress tracking and completion certificates</li>
    <li>Community-driven learning environment</li>
    <li>Expert instructors with real-world experience</li>
    <li>Mobile-friendly responsive design</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Getting Started</h2>
  <p>Follow our <a href="/docs/installation">Installation</a> guide to set up the project locally, then check out the <a href="/docs/usage">Usage</a> documentation to learn how to use Yora Academy.</p>

  <h2>Architecture</h2>
  <p>Yora Academy is built with modern web technologies including:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Astro for static site generation</li>
    <li>Tailwind CSS for styling</li>
    <li>TypeScript for type safety</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Contributing</h2>
  <p>We welcome contributions! Please read our contribution guidelines before submitting pull requests.</p>
</DocsLayout>